OL,3,ARachel Jupp is a bold choice for BBC
OL,4,ANews chief, says Katie Razzall
OL,5,
OL,6,FRachel Jupp is a bold choice for the
OL,7,FBBC's director of news. She is a
OL,8,Fwell-regarded high flier who has
OL,9,Fimpressed in her roles at Panorama,
OL,10,FNewsnight and Channel 4 News.
OL,12,FShe is currently the BBC's director of
OL,13,Fnews documentaries and long form
OL,14,Fjournalism. But she hasn't been in that
OL,15,Frole for long and hasn't spent years
OL,16,Fleading huge teams of people (BBC News'
OL,17,Fglobal newsroom has around 4,500
OL,18,Fstaff).
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
