OL,3,ARachel Jupp is a bold choice for BBC
OL,4,ANews chief, says Katie Razzall
OL,5,
OL,6,FA lack of that kind of experience might
OL,7,Fhave been problematic in the past. But
OL,8,Fthe BBC's new director general comes
OL,9,Ffrom Google. Tech companies regularly
OL,10,Fappoint people who may not have the
OL,11,Fdirect experience for a role but have
OL,12,Fthe strategic vision and drive to make
OL,13,Fa difference. He is talking about
OL,14,Fdistinctive journalism and reinvention.
OL,16,FJupp's appointment signals a direction
OL,17,Fof travel both on the change that the
OL,18,Fnew boss thinks is required and also on
OL,19,Fthe use of technology.
